      "writtenOn": "2018-12-01T03:24:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Type seems to be too generic. Also, I don\u0027t like having the option to not generate normal (image) APEX. We should always generate the image APEX and this option should control whether or not to generate the zip APEX.\n\nSo, perhaps, `Gen_zip_apex bool` ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 218,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 218,
        "endChar": 6
      },
      "revId": "394cdf87a4a65b95e5197b36c4f5a1acbc18654c",
